    // the window's content rect handed over unswapped made the app lay itself out 643 x 932 in a 932 x 643 landscape window -- a narrow portrait
    // layout with Zetsu's khaki background filling the rest. (iPadOS 16 keeps windowed scenes at orientation 1, so nothing changes there.)
