    // Once SpringBoard has been seen unlocked for 2 s, any Cover Sheet that comes down later is the user's (or the status bar clock's Today
    // View), not the post-respring Lock Screen: never "unlock" it (seen on the iPad 2: it fired at a Today View opened 16 s after a respring).
